  "fashion": {
    "Overview": "The Cani aesthetic is centered on brand-name sportswear and conspicuous accessories, often featuring counterfeit or bootleg items. The \"classic\" Cani look of the 2000s included tracksuits, muscle shirts, and bootleg football team jerseys. Accessories were central, with a heavy emphasis on gold jewelry such as large chains and rings, as well as piercings in the eyebrow or lip. Baseball caps worn sideways or backward, often from brands like Nike, were also a key element."
  },
